<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 15:12:48 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>研究发现，狗和猫携带的抗生素耐药细菌也存在于人类身上</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/dogs-and-cats-carry-antibiotic-resistant-bacteria-also-found-in-people-study-finds</link><description>伯恩茅斯大学的最新研究表明，狗和猫可能携带肺炎克雷伯菌菌株，这是一种可能引起感染的严重细菌，在人类中也发现了这种细菌&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/dogs-and-cats-carry-antibiotic-resistant-bacteria-also-found-in-people-study-finds.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 15:12:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/dogs-and-cats-carry-antibiotic-resistant-bacteria-also-found-in-people-study-finds</guid></item><item><title>酵母可能有助于在火星上建造家园</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/yeast-may-help-build-homes-on-mars</link><description>转基因酵母与明胶混合创造出一种耐用的生物材料，可以帮助在恶劣的火星条件下建立栖息地。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/yeast-may-help-build-homes-on-mars.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:57:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/yeast-may-help-build-homes-on-mars</guid></item><item><title>热量限制揭示了减缓与年龄相关的 DNA 突变的潜在方法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/calorie-restriction-reveals-a-potential-way-to-slow-age-related-dna-mutations</link><description>突变是构成DNA（细胞遗传蓝图）的分子“字母”的变化。当 DNA 受损或细胞在修复或复制 DNA 时出错时，每个细胞都会随着年龄的增长而产生突变。大多数突变是无害的，但当它们破坏基因时，就会导致癌症和其他疾病。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/calorie-restriction-reveals-a-potential-way-to-slow-age-related-dna-mutations.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:42:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/calorie-restriction-reveals-a-potential-way-to-slow-age-related-dna-mutations</guid></item><item><title>研究人员以创纪录的精度精确定位早期宇宙的关键测量</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/researchers-pinpoint-key-early-universe-measurement-with-record-precision</link><description>包括明尼苏达大学双城分校研究人员在内的一个国际团队以前所未有的精度测量了宇宙前五分钟内产生的氦气量，从而达到了“精密宇宙学”的一个重要里程碑。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/researchers-pinpoint-key-early-universe-measurement-with-record-precision.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:27:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/researchers-pinpoint-key-early-universe-measurement-with-record-precision</guid></item><item><title>从 2000 年代生产到最后的笔记本电脑，不需要一个加密狗💻🗿 #shorts #laptop #computer #pc</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/laptop-from-2000s-build-to-last-and-didnt-need-a-single-dongle-%f0%9f%92%bb%f0%9f%97%bf-shorts-laptop-computer-pc</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:12:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/laptop-from-2000s-build-to-last-and-didnt-need-a-single-dongle-%f0%9f%92%bb%f0%9f%97%bf-shorts-laptop-computer-pc</guid></item><item><title>一艘 18.7 英尺长的无人机船为意大利测量人员带回了第一张海底地图</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/an-18-7-foot-drone-boat-has-brought-back-its-first-seabed-maps-for-an-italian-survey-crew</link><description>因此，公司在过去几年里一直在缩小船的尺寸，把人们留在海滩上。大多数出现新闻的都是军事人士，比如&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/an-18-7-foot-drone-boat-has-brought-back-its-first-seabed-maps-for-an-italian-survey-crew.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 13:57:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/an-18-7-foot-drone-boat-has-brought-back-its-first-seabed-maps-for-an-italian-survey-crew</guid></item><item><title>对陌生人做出👌手势</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/make-the-%f0%9f%91%8c-sign-at-a-stranger</link><description>在世界的某些地方，你只是称他为混蛋。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/make-the-f09f918c-sign-at-a-stranger.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 13:42:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/make-the-%f0%9f%91%8c-sign-at-a-stranger</guid></item><item><title>靶向纳米粒子增强肿瘤的抗癌免疫反应</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/targeted-nanoparticles-strengthen-anti-cancer-immune-responses-in-tumors</link><description>阿德莱德大学研究人员开发出一种新方法，利用mRNA技术对肿瘤支持免疫细胞进行重新编程，增强人体的抗癌免疫反应。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/targeted-nanoparticles-strengthen-anti-cancer-immune-responses-in-tumors.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 13:27:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/targeted-nanoparticles-strengthen-anti-cancer-immune-responses-in-tumors</guid></item><item><title>1.7K 次观看 · 21 条反应</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/1-7k-views-%c2%b7-21-reactions</link><description>大脑每晚的“清理”能否通过声音放大？新的研究表明这是可能的。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/1-7k-views-c2b7-21-reactions.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 13:12:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/1-7k-views-%c2%b7-21-reactions</guid></item><item><title>科学家熔化了钻石并破解了冰巨星的秘密</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-melted-a-diamond-and-cracked-a-secret-of-ice-giants</link><description>询问行星科学家，他们会告诉您钻石并不是那么罕见。事实上，有数十亿吨的它们隐藏在我们太阳系及其他行星的深处。最热情的人会告诉你关于钻石雨的事——行星的温度和压力非常高，以至于钻石熔化并形成液体，落向行星的核心。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-melted-a-diamond-and-cracked-a-secret-of-ice-giants2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 12:57:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-melted-a-diamond-and-cracked-a-secret-of-ice-giants</guid></item></channel></rss>